{'symbol': 'ADI', 'date': '2021-05-26 08:30:00', 'title': 'ANALOG DEVICES EXPANDS BMS PORTFOLIO TO ENABLE CONTINUOUS BATTERY MONITORING', 'text': "WILMINGTON, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ANALOG DEVICES, INC. (NASDAQ: ADI) ANNOUNCED TODAY ITS EXPANDED PORTFOLIO OF BATTERY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM (BMS) PRODUCTS INCLUDING ASIL-D FUNCTIONAL SAFETY AND INNOVATIVE NEW LOW-POWER FEATURES TO ENABLE CONTINUOUS BATTERY MONITORING. THESE NEW DEVICES FURTHER DIFFERENTIATE ADI'S BMS PLATFORM THAT TODAY DELIVERS THE INDUSTRY'S BEST PROVEN ACCURACY, AND SUPPORTS ALL KEY BATTERY CHEMISTRIES—INCLUDING ZERO-COBALT LFP (LITHIUM IRON PHOSPHATE)—FOR MASS MARKET ELECTRI"}